OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for recording female
OL,4,Acolleagues using toilet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man, who secretly recorded female
OL,7,Fcolleagues using the toilet at a
OL,8,Fhospital where they worked has been
OL,9,Fjailed for five months.
OL,11,FDavid O'Hara, 44, of Sea Coast Road in
OL,12,FLimavady, had previously pleaded guilty
OL,13,Fto voyeurism by planting a camera in a
OL,14,Funisex toilet.
OL,16,FHe further admitted voyeurism by
OL,17,Frecording at least 23 females doing a
OL,18,Fprivate act in the toilet which was for
OL,19,Fhis own sexual gratification.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
